The mid-sixth century for his birth date was proposed in [KQVXHPVH].</note></person><person xml:id="person3892"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">sa skya paN+Di ta kun dga' rgyal mtshan</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">ས་སྐྱ་པཎྜི་ཏ་ཀུན་དགའ་རྒྱལ་མཚན</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">sa skya paṇḍita</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">chos rje sa paN</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">chos rje</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">chos kyi rje</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">rigs gter gangs can mkhas pa'i gtsug rgyan</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">sa paN</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">sa skya lo tsA ba</persName><birth notBefore="1182-01-01" notAfter="1182-12-31">1182</birth><death notBefore="1251-01-01" notAfter="1251-12-31">1251</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P1056</idno><idno type="APIS">3892</idno><note type="comment">See [8S7FDMCJ]: 107 for a list of his most important disciples.</note></person><person xml:id="person3899"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">g.yag sde paN chen brtson 'grus dar rgyas</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">གཡག་སྡེ་པཎ་ཆེན་བརྩོན་འགྲུས་དར་རྒྱས</persName><birth notBefore="1299-01-01" notAfter="1299-12-31">1299</birth><death notBefore="1378-01-01" notAfter="1378-12-31">1378</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P4312</idno><idno type="APIS">3899</idno></person><person xml:id="person4068"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">jo nang lo tsA ba blo gros dpal bzang</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">ཇོ་ནང་ལོ་ཙཱ་བ་བློ་གྲོས་དཔལ་བཟང</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">jo nang lo tsA ba blo gros dpal</persName><birth notBefore="1299-01-01" notAfter="1299-12-31">1299</birth><death notBefore="1353-01-01" notAfter="1364-12-31">after 1353 before 1364</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P153</idno><idno type="APIS">4068</idno><note type="comment">Dates: 1299-1353 or 1300-1364 ([BAQ9MH4T]: 172).</note></person><person xml:id="person4094"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">gnas drug pa blo gros mtshungs med</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">གནས་དྲུག་པ་བློ་གྲོས་མཚུངས་མེད</persName><birth notBefore="1300-01-01" notAfter="1330-12-31">after 1300 before 1330</birth><death notBefore="1371-01-01" notAfter="1400-12-31">after 1371 before 1400</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="APIS">4094</idno><note type="comment">Sa skya pa scholar of the 14th c. Floruit 1330-1371 ([BAQ9MH4T]: 320 and 322-323).&#13;
Credited with a commentary on the Tshad ma rigs gter (ID:5564) ([MKQ6FJV7]: 61, n. 7).</note></person><person xml:id="person4097"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">dpang lo tsA ba blo gros brtan pa</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">དཔང་ལོ་ཙཱ་བ་བློ་གྲོས་བརྟན་པ</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">dpang blo gros brtan pa</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">btsun chung lu gu</persName><birth notBefore="1276-01-01" notAfter="1276-12-31">1276</birth><death notBefore="1342-01-01" notAfter="1342-12-31">1342</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P2085</idno><idno type="APIS">4097</idno><note type="comment">A short biography from the Shel dkar chos 'byung is translated in [N35FPQ6L]: 62-70. It gives a fire-male-mouse year (1276) as birth-date, and Gyam in Zur rtso as its birthplace. He took novice vows when he was five years old at 'Brog rdo gling, and was ordained at seven.</note></person><person xml:id="person4127"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">stag sde pa seng ge rgyal mtshan</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">སྟག་སྡེ་པ་སེང་གེ་རྒྱལ་མཚན</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">seng+ge rgyal mtshan</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">stag sde pa seng ge rgyal mtshan</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">mkhas pa rta ste gseng rgyal</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">rta'i lta ba seng rgyal</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">stag sde ba</persName><birth notBefore="1212-01-01" notAfter="1212-12-31">1212</birth><death notBefore="1294-01-01" notAfter="1294-12-31">1294</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P2374</idno><idno type="APIS">4127</idno><note type="comment">Was also the editor of a manuscript of rNgog Blo ldan shes rab's translation of the Pramāṇaviniścaya. Pr